        <body>
            <div xml:id="d521">

                <pb facs="0501" n="491" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg491"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Executive Secretariat Files</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Note by the Executive Secretary of the National Security
                        Council</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Souers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Council </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1949-02-28">February 28, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">NSC 34/2</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">U.S. Policy Toward China</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The attached report by the Secretary of State on the subject is submitted
                    herewith for consideration by the National Security Council and, at his request,
                    is scheduled as Item 2 on the Agenda for the 35th Council Meeting to be held on
                    Thursday, March 3, 1949.</p>
                <p>It is recommended that, if the Council adopts the enclosed report, it be
                    forwarded to the President with the recommendation that he approve the
                    recommendations contained therein and direct their implementation by all
                    appropriate executive departments and agencies <pb facs="0502" n="492"
                        xml:id="pg492"/> of the U.S. Government under the coordination of the
                    Secretary of State.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sidney</hi> W. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Souers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d521-a1.xml" xpointer="d521-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
